---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | FormFix India" description="Privacy policy for FormFix India: browser-local processing, no document uploads, and no advertising scripts.">
<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 max-w-2xl">Your files stay on your device. Here is exactly what happens — and what does not.</p>
<div class="space-y-4 mt-6">
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🔒</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">Processing in your browser</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">All document processing in this version happens locally in your browser. This site does not create an upload endpoint, does not send your document bytes, images, filenames or contents to a server, analytics provider or advertising vendor, and does not save uploaded files to localStorage, IndexedDB or other persistent browser storage. Temporary object URLs and canvases are released when you reset a tool or leave the page.</p></article>
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">Limitations</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Browser-local processing does not protect a file already on a shared device, and it does not make a downloaded output private. No advertising script is loaded, and no analytics provider receives your document data.</p></article>
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">✉️</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">Contact for privacy questions</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">See the <a class="underline font-bold" href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p></article>
</div>
</Base>
